WEBVTT

00:03.960 --> 00:05.000
<b>I'm waiting by the platform.</b>

00:03.960 --> 00:05.000
<b>I'm almost done changing! Sorry!!</b>

00:05.750 --> 00:06.880
<b>be there soon</b>

00:09.000 --> 00:10.420
<b>FRIENDS: 1</b>

00:09.000 --> 00:10.420
<b>Ririsa Amano</b>

00:10.460 --> 00:11.960
I have a friend...

00:20.920 --> 00:22.500
Are you Nonoa?

00:26.630 --> 00:28.210
Nagomi-san?!

00:28.960 --> 00:30.210
But why?!

02:02.000 --> 02:06.960
<b>I'll Keep Evolving</b>

02:07.250 --> 02:08.580
But why?!

02:08.580 --> 02:10.750
Yeah, you look exactly like Coulia.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.580
Oh no!

02:13.750 --> 02:16.000
Did things work out between her and Liliel?

02:13.750 --> 02:18.630
<b>WORRY WORRY</b>

02:16.000 --> 02:18.290
I guess I could ask later, but...

02:18.750 --> 02:21.330
Did you seriously pick a fight with Liliel?

02:23.380 --> 02:24.710
You're not even denying it.

02:24.710 --> 02:25.500
No!

02:25.500 --> 02:27.080
Don't give me that look.

02:27.080 --> 02:29.210
If you're not gonna say no,
I'll take that as a yes!

02:29.380 --> 02:30.750
Come on!

02:30.750 --> 02:33.290
That's fine.
I get where you're coming from.

02:34.040 --> 02:37.210
I get being jealous of other girls who
are more popular or more attractive.

02:37.210 --> 02:38.210
I'm not, though.

02:38.210 --> 02:41.210
But, it's gross to punch down, you know?

02:41.210 --> 02:44.500
If you wanna pick a fight with someone,
then aim for the top and go after me!

02:44.500 --> 02:46.330
I don't care what people think of me.

02:48.830 --> 02:53.080
If they want me to be the bad guy,
I'll be the bad guy.

02:53.080 --> 02:55.630
That means everyone can
team up against me and be friends.

02:55.920 --> 02:58.210
Everyone wants attention.

02:58.210 --> 03:02.130
You might think other cosplayers
are fighting you for that attention,

03:02.130 --> 03:05.130
but you've got something
in common with them:

03:05.130 --> 03:07.920
you had the courage to go out and cosplay.

03:07.920 --> 03:11.420
That's enough to make you an ally.
A friend.

03:13.000 --> 03:15.710
Don't forget that, okay?

03:16.080 --> 03:17.460
<b>Whoa...</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:19.380
<b>Whoa...</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:19.380
<b>We're friends...</b>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.000
Thank you.

03:22.000 --> 03:23.880
But, you've...

03:24.250 --> 03:25.670
You've got it all wrong.

03:25.670 --> 03:28.500
You can speak?
Wait, what did I get wrong?

03:28.500 --> 03:30.670
Nagomi-san, you're so freaking cool!

03:31.170 --> 03:33.540
Where the hell did you come from?!

03:34.040 --> 03:36.880
Oh. So you worked things out.

03:37.210 --> 03:39.670
Wait, did you hear all that?!

03:39.670 --> 03:40.920
What are you, stalking me?!

03:40.920 --> 03:42.670
You did so good, Nagomi.

03:42.670 --> 03:44.330
I'm gonna remember this when

03:44.330 --> 03:46.380
I'm lying in bed and
fall asleep cringing about it!

03:46.380 --> 03:47.250
Other people do that, too...

03:47.250 --> 03:48.500
Other people do that, too.

03:48.500 --> 03:49.960
...other people do that, too.

03:52.170 --> 03:53.170
Nagomi-san.

03:55.710 --> 03:58.790
Ririsa told me you gave her advice, too.

03:58.790 --> 04:00.500
That was really nice of you.

04:00.880 --> 04:05.210
Y-yeah, if you ever need help, just text me...

04:06.250 --> 04:07.500
I did it.

04:08.250 --> 04:12.580
I said the thing I needed to say.
I can speak again!

04:15.580 --> 04:19.540
Wait, you like Liliel too, Nonoa-chan?!

04:19.540 --> 04:20.880
Y-yeah!

04:20.880 --> 04:22.290
I'm so thrilled!

04:22.290 --> 04:23.290
Y-yeah, I've liked her since I was a kid...

04:23.290 --> 04:25.710
Y-yeah, I've liked her since I was a kid...

04:23.290 --> 04:25.710
I'm speaking, but I'm so nervous.

04:25.710 --> 04:26.540
I'm speaking, but I'm so nervous.

04:26.540 --> 04:28.170
I haven't had a conversation in so long.

04:28.790 --> 04:32.210
And I've never had a friend before.

04:32.210 --> 04:35.130
B-but I'll be okay.

04:35.130 --> 04:37.210
I know how to talk about this.
I can talk forever about Liliel.

04:37.210 --> 04:38.040
Don't do it.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.040
You go away!

04:40.040 --> 04:42.130
The second you start talking,
she'll stop liking you.

04:42.380 --> 04:44.920
Where should I start? What should I say?

04:44.920 --> 04:47.960
There's just so many things I like,
I don't know where to start!

04:47.960 --> 04:50.380
Between the manga, the anime, and the movie,
there's so much I could talk about.

04:50.380 --> 04:53.540
But my favorite thing is how
she's so devoted to Lord Ashford!

04:53.540 --> 04:56.250
You see female characters
like her in shonen manga, but...

04:56.250 --> 04:57.540
Stop avoiding it and remember what happened!

04:59.080 --> 05:02.920
Like, you just keep rambling,
and don't even try to connect it with our conversation.

05:02.920 --> 05:07.250
It's like you don't even listen to us.
Conversation's supposed to go back and forth!

05:07.250 --> 05:08.750
I know, right?

05:08.750 --> 05:12.750
I bet instead of listening,
you're just planning out what you wanna say next.

05:12.750 --> 05:15.420
That's not communication, you know.

05:23.170 --> 05:27.670
R-Ririsa-chan, what do you like about Liliel?!

05:34.380 --> 05:37.290
Oh man, so many things, I can't name just one!

05:37.290 --> 05:39.460
I was gonna say the same thing!

05:39.460 --> 05:41.080
You totally get it!

05:41.250 --> 05:43.000
I'll go in story order,

05:41.500 --> 05:48.040
<b>HEH HEH HEH</b>

05:43.000 --> 05:45.500
starting with the prequel episode
bundled with the movie DVD pre-order.

05:45.500 --> 05:48.080
Yes! I love that episode!

05:48.080 --> 05:50.420
And you know that one awesome scene?!

05:50.420 --> 05:51.630
Totally!

05:51.630 --> 05:52.420
Right?!

05:52.420 --> 05:53.000
Yeah!

05:57.710 --> 05:59.080
I get it now.

05:59.460 --> 06:01.130
You're not the villain.

06:01.420 --> 06:07.710
You remembered how badly I got hurt,
and have been trying to protect me.

06:09.290 --> 06:10.460
I'm sorry.

06:10.830 --> 06:12.170
And thank you.

06:13.460 --> 06:16.250
I wasn't in the wrong. She was.

06:16.830 --> 06:21.130
That's what I believed,
but it wasn't the full truth.

06:21.710 --> 06:25.460
She was wrong to say that to me,
but what I did was wrong, too.

06:25.920 --> 06:31.380
And when I didn't want to admit that,
I used it as an excuse to escape it all.

06:32.170 --> 06:33.250
But it's okay.

06:33.250 --> 06:37.130
If I make a mistake,
all I have to do is change.

06:37.130 --> 06:38.960
I'll keep evolving.

06:39.580 --> 06:43.210
So that's why Liliel's lines in that scene in the
new movie are both a callback to the old movie

06:40.630 --> 06:54.540
<b>RRRMMMBLE</b>

06:43.210 --> 06:47.210
AND an answer to the mixed reception the scene
in the old movie got when it was released!

06:47.210 --> 06:51.790
Now when you go back and rewatch the
old movie it makes so much more sense!

06:51.790 --> 06:53.500
Ten years out,
and Liliel just keeps getting deeper!

06:53.500 --> 06:54.540
It's incredible, really!

06:55.710 --> 06:57.920
Oh, sorry, I keep going on and on...

07:01.750 --> 07:03.330
I wasn't that bad, was I?!

07:03.330 --> 07:04.920
No, you're fine.

07:04.920 --> 07:07.790
Then why are you laughing at me?!
Come on!

07:08.500 --> 07:10.290
I won't have that nightmare again...

07:11.500 --> 07:15.210
...because today,
I get to have fun with my friend.

07:24.630 --> 07:26.750
Hey, Lost and Found, right?!

07:26.750 --> 07:28.630
Did someone turn in a wallet?!

07:28.630 --> 07:30.500
Yes, we have some wallets.

07:30.500 --> 07:32.670
We've got lots of items today.

07:32.670 --> 07:33.750
What did yours look like?

07:33.750 --> 07:37.790
I also lost my phone, my train card holder,
my makeup pouch, and my keys!

07:38.580 --> 07:42.580
These are all yours, I think?
They got turned in separately, too...

07:42.580 --> 07:44.500
Oh, thank god!

07:45.710 --> 07:48.580
I always make sure I
don't lose my hairpin,

07:48.580 --> 07:51.000
but then everything else goes missing!

07:51.000 --> 07:51.880
How?

07:51.880 --> 07:54.540
You girls are the best.
Thanks!

07:57.540 --> 08:01.330
She was super pretty.
She looked like she walked right out of a manga.

08:01.330 --> 08:04.420
She's a cosplayer, right?
I didn't see her walking around, though...

08:04.420 --> 08:08.040
Yeah, I didn't.
How the heck did we miss her?

08:08.630 --> 08:11.210
I'm so glad I got pics of Nonoa-chan today!

08:11.210 --> 08:13.170
And we got pics of her with Liliel!

08:13.380 --> 08:15.250
Check out this one, the angle is perfect.

08:15.250 --> 08:16.830
They're so cute!

08:16.830 --> 08:19.080
Ohmigod, who are they?
They're adorbs!

08:19.080 --> 08:22.040
Wait, that huge crowd of randos was for two girls?!

08:22.040 --> 08:23.080
Randos?

08:23.380 --> 08:27.210
Liliel and Nonoa, right? Cool, got it.

08:27.210 --> 08:29.250
A gyaru just touched me...

08:29.250 --> 08:31.040
Oh, god, an extrovert.

08:31.630 --> 08:33.830
W-what's your handle?

08:34.960 --> 08:36.130
Handle?

08:36.130 --> 08:38.670
Um, you're a cosplayer, right?

08:38.670 --> 08:41.830
Oh, yeah! I literally just started.

08:42.250 --> 08:44.330
I'm Aria Kisaki.

08:44.630 --> 08:48.040
Remember that name, 'cause soon,
I'm gonna be famous!

08:56.330 --> 08:57.670
Nonoa-chan!

08:59.580 --> 09:01.540
R-Ririsa-chan!

09:03.130 --> 09:04.830
What cosplay is that?

09:04.830 --> 09:06.330
I-it's just my school uniform.

09:06.330 --> 09:07.210
It's so cute!

09:09.000 --> 09:10.750
Thanks for coming out after school.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.750
Sure, it wasn't that far away...

09:13.380 --> 09:15.250
I'm so happy I could die.

09:15.500 --> 09:17.790
Thank you for joining us for
the shoot today, Nonoa-san.

09:17.790 --> 09:19.830
Oh, no, thank you...

09:19.830 --> 09:22.040
Actually... Could you drop the formality a little?

09:22.040 --> 09:24.790
I'm in the same grade as Ririsa-chan...

09:24.790 --> 09:26.170
That's right, Senpai!

09:26.170 --> 09:28.830
Yes, I-I mean, yeah!

09:30.630 --> 09:33.830
I can't believe I finally get to take pictures
with another cosplayer at a real studio!

09:33.830 --> 09:37.080
I'm so happy I have cosplay friends!

09:37.080 --> 09:38.960
M-me too.

09:39.580 --> 09:43.130
This is the first time I've gone
out with friends after school...

09:43.290 --> 09:46.460
Isn't renting studio space expensive?
How much is it gonna be?

09:46.460 --> 09:48.080
Oh, actually...

09:48.460 --> 09:52.920
This one is run by
Mayura-sama's friend, Chika-chan.

09:53.210 --> 09:57.880
Hey, there.
Are you the girls Mayura-chan mentioned?

09:59.290 --> 10:00.790
Gosh, you're young.

10:01.170 --> 10:03.040
Do I need to call the cops on her?

10:03.040 --> 10:04.710
Nope, she hasn't done anything weird yet!

10:04.710 --> 10:06.130
What do you mean, yet?

10:06.130 --> 10:08.500
Oh, I know that uniform...

10:09.080 --> 10:10.710
You know Ta-chan, the English teacher?

10:10.710 --> 10:12.130
He and I are drinking buddies.

10:12.330 --> 10:13.750
C-cool.

10:13.750 --> 10:16.460
So you must be her pretty friend, Morichika-san!

10:16.460 --> 10:17.750
Oh, sweetheart, call me Chika-chan.

10:17.750 --> 10:18.830
I get it now.

10:19.460 --> 10:24.210
Mayura had me crossdress anytime she
needed a guy character in her group.

10:24.210 --> 10:26.420
Keep your mouth shut.
You'll ruin the cosplay.

10:26.420 --> 10:27.920
Wow, rude.

10:28.330 --> 10:29.790
Crossdress...?

10:29.790 --> 10:32.420
Friends of hers get special discounts.

10:32.420 --> 10:36.130
How much would it be for three
hours in the Fantasy Room?

10:36.380 --> 10:37.580
Free fifty, honey.

10:37.580 --> 10:38.420
Huh?!

10:38.420 --> 10:40.580
Whatever's not booked is yours to have fun in.

10:40.580 --> 10:42.080
Are you sure?

10:42.790 --> 10:45.290
We own the whole building.

10:45.630 --> 10:48.170
The tenants on the first and second floors pay rent.

10:48.170 --> 10:50.130
I run the studio space here for fun.

10:50.670 --> 10:53.630
I don't have time to cosplay anymore,

10:53.630 --> 10:58.790
so the least I can do is help
out the up-and-coming newbies.

10:59.210 --> 11:01.460
You can pay me back by getting famous, mmkay?

11:02.670 --> 11:04.250
Thank you so much!

11:04.630 --> 11:07.170
You can recommend me to your friends, too!

11:07.170 --> 11:11.710
I've got a camera and can take pics
if they want to come on their own!

11:12.210 --> 11:13.880
Oh, wow!

11:14.170 --> 11:15.750
You did Mayura-sama's ROMs?!

11:15.750 --> 11:17.830
Whoa... You don't need me, then.

11:18.170 --> 11:19.330
Want my help today?

11:19.330 --> 11:21.250
No, that's okay!

11:21.670 --> 11:24.920
Senpai's the only person
I trust for pictures of my Liliel!

11:25.330 --> 11:27.330
Aww, you two are cute.

11:28.040 --> 11:30.380
If he gets hit by a truck and dies,
call me, mmkay?

11:30.380 --> 11:32.380
Sure! I'll give you a call!

11:32.380 --> 11:33.540
Should I worry?

11:32.380 --> 11:33.540
Dies?

11:34.000 --> 11:36.710
I'm gonna take pictures for a
solo cosplayer today, actually.

11:36.710 --> 11:41.580
She's a newbie looking for friends,
but she's a little weird.

11:41.580 --> 11:42.210
Weird?

11:42.210 --> 11:45.330
Let me know if you wanna meet her,
and I'll arrange something.

11:48.420 --> 11:51.670
So it's a Western fantasy theme!

11:52.330 --> 11:55.710
They've got all this antique furniture and props, too.

11:58.830 --> 12:02.040
I can get some great shots by the window.

12:02.420 --> 12:05.670
Ever since Ogino-san's lesson,

12:05.670 --> 12:08.130
I've been looking forward to
my next shoot in a studio.

12:08.960 --> 12:12.170
Senpai's the only person
I trust for pictures of my Liliel!

12:12.420 --> 12:16.170
If that's right, then I've really gotta
knock it out of the park today.

12:16.540 --> 12:20.290
Wait, but Cinderella Stars Liliel is modern day,
not Western fantasy.

12:20.290 --> 12:22.830
Or did Nonoa bring a new costume today?

12:23.630 --> 12:26.460
Nonoa-chan, I hope you didn't
have trouble with the costume.

12:26.920 --> 12:29.460
Sorry to ask you to make one for my series.

12:29.460 --> 12:31.380
No, no, it's okay!

12:31.380 --> 12:34.040
I couldn't make the weapon, though...

12:34.460 --> 12:36.960
Because I put everything
I had into making this new outfit!

12:36.960 --> 12:38.750
I was ready to make anything,

12:38.750 --> 12:41.460
so long as I got to be in
a group with Liliel-chan!

12:42.000 --> 12:45.710
Also, are you okay with getting
your photos taken by a guy?

12:45.710 --> 12:47.330
Yeah, why?

12:48.380 --> 12:50.880
Mikari-chan said she
wanted him to take her picture,

12:49.790 --> 12:58.580
<b>HMMMM</b>

12:50.880 --> 12:52.960
so I figured it was okay,

12:52.960 --> 12:55.460
and I also don't want anyone
but him taking my picture...

12:55.460 --> 12:58.170
but I need to make sure
I respect how she feels!

12:58.670 --> 13:00.540
I didn't even think of that.

13:00.750 --> 13:03.330
I figured that was normal for cosplay.

13:03.330 --> 13:04.670
That's normal at events, anyways.

13:03.330 --> 13:04.670
I totally didn't expect that!

13:04.670 --> 13:06.330
That's normal at events, anyways.

13:05.750 --> 13:09.290
<b>COMPLETELY UNBOTHERED</b>

13:06.330 --> 13:08.670
I guess it'd be weird if I were alone with a guy...

13:08.670 --> 13:10.420
Oh, and it doesn't really matter,

13:10.420 --> 13:13.170
'cause Senpai's not interested in girls at all!

13:13.170 --> 13:15.080
Okay. No idea what that means.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.170
Still...

13:17.460 --> 13:21.750
I feel like I can trust Okumura-senpai.

13:23.290 --> 13:24.670
That's good.

13:24.670 --> 13:26.500
Okay, let's get changed as fast as the wind!

13:26.500 --> 13:28.170
We're gonna knock Senpai's socks off!

13:28.170 --> 13:29.790
Can we get changed normally?!

13:31.750 --> 13:33.580
Okay, we're ready, Senpai!

13:33.580 --> 13:35.080
Sorry about the wait.

13:38.290 --> 13:42.330
Angelic Airborne Defense Squadron Captain Nokiel!

13:42.710 --> 13:44.000
Of course!

13:44.330 --> 13:46.420
They're doing the Airborne Defense Squadron
from the spinoff!

13:46.420 --> 13:48.790
There are so many more
female characters in that series!

13:48.790 --> 13:50.580
It's perfect for a group cosplay!

13:50.580 --> 13:51.750
No, more than perfect!

13:51.750 --> 13:52.500
How could I have missed this?!

13:52.500 --> 13:53.830
How could I have missed this?!

13:52.500 --> 13:53.830
Is he okay?

13:53.830 --> 13:56.040
It's so simple! I'm a fool!

13:53.830 --> 13:56.040
We'll get started once he's done freaking out.

13:56.040 --> 13:56.960
An utter fool!

13:57.380 --> 13:59.040
Okay, let's get started.

14:00.080 --> 14:03.080
Okay, Senpai!
I think the spot by the window could be good!

14:04.580 --> 14:10.290
It was hard to tell in the manga and anime,
but Nokiel's a bit taller than Liliel.

14:10.960 --> 14:13.080
It's cool seeing it in real life!

14:13.500 --> 14:18.000
And the studio set makes it look like
a scene straight from the anime!

14:19.710 --> 14:20.670
Next up...

14:20.670 --> 14:22.830
Nonoa-chan, can I hug you?

14:23.880 --> 14:25.330
Y-yeah, sure!

14:25.330 --> 14:26.880
Nokiel!

14:29.290 --> 14:30.920
Nokiel, thank you!

14:30.920 --> 14:32.880
Liliel-sama, your ch-chest...

14:32.880 --> 14:35.420
This is straight out of the manga!

14:36.250 --> 14:38.420
Liliel hugged me...

14:38.420 --> 14:40.330
Senpai, can I see the picture?

14:40.330 --> 14:42.290
Already? Sure.

14:42.710 --> 14:45.250
We look so good!
You're incredible, Senpai!

14:45.250 --> 14:47.670
Text this one to me!

14:47.670 --> 14:50.170
I'm a little embarrassed to look at pictures of myself...

14:51.130 --> 14:54.170
But this is so much fun.
I'm so happy.

14:56.750 --> 15:00.750
Um, could you send that picture to me?

15:02.080 --> 15:03.790
Yeah, sure.

15:03.790 --> 15:05.000
Nokiel's talking to me!

15:05.540 --> 15:07.420
Cosplay is crazy.

15:08.130 --> 15:10.210
I can't believe this is the same person.

15:10.750 --> 15:13.500
Can I post this picture online?

15:13.500 --> 15:14.330
Sure, go ahead!

15:14.630 --> 15:16.500
You've got a social media account?

15:16.500 --> 15:17.630
Can I see it?

15:17.630 --> 15:19.460
Sure, but it's pretty boring.

15:20.080 --> 15:20.750
<b>my stomach hurts</b>

15:21.460 --> 15:22.210
<b>just had dinner</b>

15:21.960 --> 15:23.630
Your feed reminds me

15:22.920 --> 15:23.880
<b>hungry</b>

15:23.630 --> 15:25.210
of a house made of plain concrete.

15:24.380 --> 15:25.170
<b>overslept</b>

15:25.210 --> 15:28.170
I got a lot of followers after
I was featured on that blog,

15:28.170 --> 15:30.710
so I've been too nervous to post anything...

15:30.880 --> 15:31.670
<b>Are you dead?</b>

15:31.330 --> 15:33.330
Tons of people are asking if you're dead.

15:33.670 --> 15:35.330
Do you have an account, Ririsa-chan?

15:35.330 --> 15:37.210
Yeah, I've got one!

15:37.790 --> 15:40.630
It's basically a Liliel reaction account though.

15:37.790 --> 15:38.380
<b>liliel addict</b>

15:39.380 --> 15:41.290
<b>Event coming up, so probably not gonna post...</b>

15:39.380 --> 15:41.290
<b>Liliel liliel liliel liliel</b>

15:41.420 --> 15:44.630
I'm not gonna make an account for my cosplay.

15:44.630 --> 15:47.080
Liliel doesn't have social media, after all.

15:47.080 --> 15:49.000
Are you trying to become an urban legend?

15:49.460 --> 15:54.500
I think it's great that Nagomi-san gets
to wear all these different outfits...

15:54.500 --> 15:58.330
But I don't want people to
think of me when I cosplay.

15:58.330 --> 16:00.250
I want to be the character.

16:01.080 --> 16:07.130
Instead of thinking "Ririsa's here!",
I want people to think "the real-life Liliel is here!"

16:08.000 --> 16:12.460
She's cosplaying Liliel for the series and fans...

16:13.000 --> 16:20.250
I picked Coulia because I wouldn't have to talk,
and Nokiel because it looked doable...

16:22.000 --> 16:24.960
I didn't put enough thought into this.
I feel horrible.

16:25.830 --> 16:29.250
Why did she even want to be friends with me?

16:29.250 --> 16:33.000
There's no way she'll like me.

16:39.830 --> 16:42.500
I'm sorry. That's not right.

16:43.250 --> 16:45.580
I'm going to be someone new.

16:46.000 --> 16:49.750
I just need to be someone who's
worthy of being Liliel's partner.

16:51.380 --> 16:55.380
Nokiel is a knight who's sworn
to protect Lilel with her life.

16:56.080 --> 17:00.920
She's my first and only friend.
I'll protect her, no matter what.

17:01.330 --> 17:04.500
I will protect you with my life, Liliel-sama.

17:07.040 --> 17:09.040
How'd I miss that perfect moment?!

17:09.250 --> 17:12.000
No way, Liliel and Nonoa?! For realsies?!

17:12.380 --> 17:15.920
Hold it, Aria-chan, I need to ask if it's okay first!

17:15.920 --> 17:16.960
Who's that?

17:16.960 --> 17:19.790
A voice that loud has to mean trouble...

17:20.130 --> 17:24.580
Sorry, I tried to stop her.
Is it okay if we interrupt?

17:24.960 --> 17:26.460
They're really here!

17:27.080 --> 17:28.960
Can I be your friend?!

17:33.040 --> 17:34.210
I'm Aria!

17:34.210 --> 17:36.830
I've been looking for you guys!

17:37.080 --> 17:37.960
She's gorgeous!

17:37.960 --> 17:39.000
Look at her big eyes...

17:39.000 --> 17:40.290
And her perfect body!

17:40.290 --> 17:42.250
A gyaru?! No wonder I'm shivering...

17:42.250 --> 17:43.290
What's a gyaru doing here?!

17:43.540 --> 17:45.170
Y-you were looking for us?

17:45.170 --> 17:46.080
Yeah, duh!

17:46.080 --> 17:51.130
I just started cosplaying,
and went to that Cinderella Stars event, right?

17:51.130 --> 17:54.710
That's where I saw a pic of you guys and ohmigod,
it was totally love at first sight!

17:54.710 --> 17:56.920
I just had to be friends with you!

17:56.920 --> 17:58.210
Friends?!

17:58.670 --> 18:03.830
I found Nonoa's account,
but her DMs were closed so I couldn't message her.

18:03.830 --> 18:06.460
I closed them so I don't get
messages from people like you!

18:06.460 --> 18:11.290
It's crazy we're here at the same time.
It's like, destiny, right?

18:11.750 --> 18:14.580
We're basically already friends!
What up, bestie?!

18:14.580 --> 18:15.830
O-okay...

18:17.250 --> 18:21.250
I nearly died getting there with her,
and she got there within five seconds!

18:21.250 --> 18:23.250
How is she already hanging off her?!

18:23.250 --> 18:25.170
Extroverts are truly terrifying...

18:25.580 --> 18:28.670
Wait, wait, ohmigosh,
let's take photos together!

18:28.670 --> 18:31.080
R-right now?! We're kinda...

18:31.710 --> 18:32.750
Look.

18:33.330 --> 18:35.080
I don't think you know,

18:35.080 --> 18:38.040
but we're actually
cosplaying from the same series.

18:38.040 --> 18:40.670
Your cosplay isn't from the Liliel spinoff, right?

18:40.670 --> 18:42.500
Then you can't take pictures with us.

18:42.500 --> 18:43.540
Wait, really?!

18:43.540 --> 18:45.540
C'mon, who cares if we're from the same series?

18:45.540 --> 18:47.170
It'll be just like the Avengers!

18:47.170 --> 18:49.080
Those are all Marvel characters!

18:49.830 --> 18:50.920
I give up.

18:52.790 --> 18:55.540
I'm an introverted otaku who didn't watch the Avengers

18:55.540 --> 18:59.170
and I don't want to hang out with someone
who compares things to the Avengers.

18:59.170 --> 19:00.710
Nonoa-chan, come back to us!

19:02.460 --> 19:03.500
Why...?

19:03.500 --> 19:06.000
Why did a random hyper gyaru
have to show up right now?

19:06.000 --> 19:10.670
The whole reason I'm an otaku cosplayer is
because I don't get along with girls like her.

19:10.670 --> 19:11.960
Nonoa-chan?

19:12.460 --> 19:19.920
Girls like her like to get in your personal space
and use slang you've never even heard of,

19:19.920 --> 19:24.670
and at school they act as if they're the
best and otaku are lesser human beings...

19:24.670 --> 19:25.960
We can never be friends.

19:25.960 --> 19:27.670
Hold on a second, Nonoa-chan!

19:27.920 --> 19:29.080
Who did this to you?!

19:29.080 --> 19:30.000
Who's the villain?!

19:30.000 --> 19:30.830
Give me their name!

19:31.540 --> 19:34.080
This girl in my class, Tanaka-san.

19:34.540 --> 19:36.920
But she isn't Tanaka-san!

19:37.750 --> 19:40.130
You don't know if she's going to be like that!

19:40.290 --> 19:41.710
Yeah...

19:42.630 --> 19:44.710
You're right, Liliel-chan.

19:44.710 --> 19:46.750
I shouldn't be so quick to judge.

19:46.920 --> 19:47.880
Right?

19:47.880 --> 19:50.460
Give her a chance,
maybe you'll be friends!

19:50.960 --> 19:52.920
Aria-chan, why did you get into cosplay?

19:52.920 --> 19:55.330
Is it because you like anime and manga?

19:56.290 --> 20:00.460
I-I guess manga?
I read a lot of it when I was little.

20:01.790 --> 20:05.250
But I wanna be a famous cosplayer!

20:05.420 --> 20:06.670
Famous?

20:06.670 --> 20:09.380
You guys just started and you're
already getting up there, right?

20:09.380 --> 20:11.710
That's why I wanted to find you and hit you up!

20:11.710 --> 20:14.790
See? We're completely different species.

20:14.790 --> 20:18.290
But she's being upfront with us,
and she doesn't seem like a bad person!

20:18.290 --> 20:20.130
I know, but...

20:20.880 --> 20:24.540
I was really excited to get to do
a shoot with the two of us...

20:25.000 --> 20:26.420
Nonoa-chan...

20:27.000 --> 20:30.080
Oh, geez, the girls are fighting...

20:30.880 --> 20:31.830
Ririsa.

20:32.710 --> 20:37.330
I know you want to be nice to everyone,
but you made plans with Nonoa today.

20:37.580 --> 20:41.630
You should tell her sorry, but no,
and make plans for another time.

20:41.630 --> 20:42.710
Senpai...

20:43.000 --> 20:44.750
Yeah, you're right.

20:44.880 --> 20:48.000
Aww, what a guy. You go, girl.

20:48.000 --> 20:51.000
Besides, when you're going after a girl in a game,
you can only do one route at a time!

20:51.000 --> 20:51.830
You're right!

20:51.830 --> 20:55.920
He could've done without the example...
But if it works for her, then sure.

20:56.210 --> 20:57.460
Sorry, Nonoa-chan...

20:58.080 --> 20:58.830
Aria-san!

20:58.830 --> 21:00.960
Hey, just call me Aria!

21:00.960 --> 21:04.130
If Liliel-chan can't do it, then I'll protect her!

21:05.250 --> 21:07.040
Whoa, you look so good!

21:07.040 --> 21:08.750
How'd you do your makeup?

21:08.750 --> 21:10.170
Listen to me!

21:11.290 --> 21:13.670
I don't know what you're thinking, Aria-san.

21:13.670 --> 21:15.330
You're drop-dead gorgeous.

21:15.330 --> 21:17.880
I bet you could go outside and
instantly get scouted for modeling.

21:18.170 --> 21:20.290
Nono-pi, you think I'm gorgeous?!

21:20.290 --> 21:21.130
Listen!

21:21.130 --> 21:22.710
Why cosplay, then?!

21:22.710 --> 21:24.830
You're already attractive as you are!

21:24.830 --> 21:28.460
If you want to be famous, just be an idol,
or a model, or an actress!

21:32.000 --> 21:33.130
I can't.

21:34.380 --> 21:36.130
It has to be cosplay.

21:38.460 --> 21:40.670
I don't want to be on TV or in magazines, just...

21:41.540 --> 21:42.710
Never mind.

21:44.790 --> 21:49.670
Well, if you care that much about it,
I guess we could take pictures together.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.040
No way, for real?!

21:53.080 --> 21:54.710
I guess if Nonoa's okay with it...

21:55.880 --> 21:58.830
So, uh, I'll get changed, but...

21:58.830 --> 22:00.210
But what?

22:03.880 --> 22:06.540
T-there's a guy in here.

22:07.540 --> 22:08.750
There's a changing room!

22:08.750 --> 22:10.000
Oh, right, I forgot!

22:10.000 --> 22:12.170
She's shyer about it than Ririsa!

22:12.580 --> 22:14.460
<b>Women's Changing Room</b>

23:56.000 --> 24:01.000
<b>Your Way, My Way</b>
